                                "sense_id": "ed43d526-9ae9-3b59-91f6-bbed1e5fb3c9",
                                "text": "Speaking in parliament on Tuesday, Yoav Gallant said Israel was “coming under attack from seven theatres: Gaza, Lebanon, Syria, Judea and Samaria [an Israeli term for the West Bank]^([sic]), Iraq, Yemen and Iran”."
                            }
